{"content":"```\nsimplify: 132 SPIR-V instructions, 10 rewrites proved by SAT (bit-precise: equal for every input), 0 dead instructions removed\n  15 loads of a variable just stored to became the stored value; 0 stores overwritten before any read removed\n  integer arithmetic cost under gt1030 (each instruction once): 88 -> 30 (-65.9%)\n  by kind:\n       1  an extract at bit 0 is a mask                 -1\n       3  equals its operand                            -7\n       3  a multiply by a power of two is a shift       -3\n       1  a divide by a power of two is a shift         -22\n       1  a remainder by a power of two is a mask       -23\n       1  always this value                             -2\n  rewrites:\n    %63 = OpUMod %uint %61 %uint_64\n      ->  OpBitwiseAnd %uint %61 %ucas_uint_63   (a remainder by a power of two is a mask; -23)\n    %50 = OpUDiv %uint %48 %uint_2\n      ->  OpShiftRightLogical %uint %48 %uint_1   (a divide by a power of two is a shift; -22)\n    %35 = OpExtInst %int %1 SClamp %33 %int_0 %int_255\n      ->  %33   (equals its operand; -4)\n    %42 = OpExtInst %uint %1 UMin %41 %uint_15\n      ->  %41   (equals its operand; -2)\n    %82 = OpULessThan %bool %80 %uint_64\n      ->  true   (always this value; -2)\n    %26 = OpBitFieldUExtract %uint %24 %int_0 %int_8\n      ->  OpBitwiseAnd %uint %22 %uint_255   (an extract at bit 0 is a mask; -1)\n    %48 = OpIMul %uint %46 %uint_4\n      ->  OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %46 %uint_2   (a multiply by a power of two is a shift; -1)\n    %54 = OpIMul %uint %52 %uint_8\n      ->  OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %26 %ucas_uint_3   (a multiply by a power of two is a shift; -1)\n    %58 = OpIMul %uint %56 %uint_16\n      ->  OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %56 %uint_4   (a multiply by a power of two is a shift; -1)\n    %85 = OpSelect %uint %82 %83 %uint_0\n      ->  %63   (equals its operand; -1)\n  proved; the operands' definitions were expanded up to 16 levels, the rest (loads, loop phis, spec constants) are free inputs\n```","embeds":[],"allowed_mentions":{"parse":[],"roles":[],"users":[],"replied_user":false},"message_reference":{"message_id":"5001","channel_id":"47","guild_id":"7","fail_if_not_exists":false},"attachments":[{"id":"0","filename":"simplified.spvasm","description":"","content_type":"text/plain","size":3774,"url":"","proxy_url":"","ephemeral":false}]}
